# Claire Bible Plugin for Claude (`{{PLUGIN_NAME}}`)

Official Claude plugin that provides `/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{INGEST_SKILL}}`, `/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{EXTRACT_SKILL}}`, `/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{QUERY_SKILL}}`, and the isolated `{{EXTRACTOR_REF}}` subagent for your standalone `claire` OAuth 2.1 Streamable HTTP MCP server (`mcp__claire__*`). It contains no server tokens or secrets.

## Full Step-by-Step Guides (단계별 안내서)

- **한국어 안내서**: [`docs/claude.ko.md`](https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/blob/main/docs/claude.ko.md)
- **English Setup Guide**: [`docs/claude.en.md`](https://github.com/{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}/blob/main/docs/claude.en.md)

## 1. Install the Plugin

Claude desktop app (Code mode): **Plugins -> Add -> Add marketplace**, enter **`{{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}`**, click **Sync**, then click **Add to this computer** next to **`{{PLUGIN_NAME}}`**.

In a Claude Code conversation (2.1.275 or later):

```text
/plugin install {{PLUGIN_NAME}} --marketplace {{MARKETPLACE_REPO}}
```

## 2. Connect Your `claire` MCP Server (`/mcp`)

Register the server with the name **`claire`** in user scope, then sign in with OAuth 2.1 (`PKCE S256`) and approve the `readonly` and `write` scopes:

```bash
claude mcp add --transport http --scope user claire https://<your-claire-server>/mcp
claude mcp login claire
```

- Without `--scope user`, the server is registered for the current folder only.
- A server that you add as a Claude connector has a different tool prefix. The plugin cannot use it.

## 3. Workflows & Security Isolation

- **`/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{INGEST_SKILL}}`**: Saves a URL, document file (PDF/DOCX/ODT/MD/TXT), or text note with `mcp__claire__extract_stage` and hands the `document_id` to `/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{EXTRACT_SKILL}}`.
- **`/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{EXTRACT_SKILL}}`**: Runs fully in the isolated `{{EXTRACTOR_REF}}` subagent (`context: fork`) and processes pending staged items of your personal KB.
- **`/{{PLUGIN_NAME}}:{{QUERY_SKILL}}`**: Discovers KBs (`mcp__claire__kb_list`), searches entities and relations, inspects documents, and can submit contributions after your approval.
- **Isolation**: Raw staged text from `mcp__claire__extract_read` is read only in `{{EXTRACTOR_PATH}}`, which has Claire MCP tools only. The fixed `PreToolUse` guard in `hooks/hooks.json` stops `extract_read` outside that subagent. Text inside `<untrusted_source_document nonce="...">` is always inert data.
